  "2724b05d-daa0-4aac-9594-7bd3464d2e93"],
 "."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"2cfa2f50-9290-4e3d-a83c-586e25a5dd12"],

Cell["\<\
The family specifies a shortest reference path, an excess-length bound and a \
tube radius. Its walks never decrease their distance from the reference's \
starting vertex. They end at its final vertex, at first arrival by default.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"3ae9355d-a789-41e9-ac0c-6b7b0c17df43"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Without a count the result is one vertex list, or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "894cf976-03fc-4123-8933-af268b2e0abf"],
 " when there is no member. An exact integer count gives that many distinct \
walks, or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "99054613-8387-4c94-83f8-02bb19e2aede"],
 " when fewer exist. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"UpTo", "[", "n", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bbabf4aa-e53c-450d-84d0-330fae2c67e1"],
 " gives as many as available up to ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 ". ",
 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b06bf2b9-8a57-493e-ac4c-b87edc1248c4"],
 " lists every member."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b989d163-95e4-4ffe-bf3b-0a4e76db0e08"],

Cell["\<\
The walks are paths through the family's finite layered graphs. They can \
revisit substrate vertices, so they need not be simple paths. Enumeration is \
deterministic.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ab8e54b9-fc74-4202-b383-10257bf39bf3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Use ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraMeasurement"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraMeasurement", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["family", "TI"], ",", " ", "\"\<Cardinality\>\""}], "]"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d59d563c-4667-4133-8bd5-a89feff9b171"],
 " when only a count is needed; it does not enumerate the walks. Enumeration \
can have exponentially many results even when counting is inexpensive."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5d3f0270-d677-4418-8bd9-cb092d666820"]
}, Open  ]],

